NNAAMMEE
     ppmmaapp__eenntteerr — insert a virtual page into a physical map

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ##iinncclluuddee <<ssyyss//ppaarraamm..hh>>
     ##iinncclluuddee <<vvmm//vvmm..hh>>
